sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Reveal and accept the estimates
    %% Stories: 9, 10, 11, 12, 33, 36
    %% Description: The estimates are shown to everyone at the same time, and the moderator accepts the average or the agreed estimate.
    actor M as Moderator
    actor PT as Participant
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item
    participant ES as Estimate

    %% covers 9
    M->>R: show the estimates
    R->>I: estimates to reveal
    I->>ES: all estimates at once
    %% covers 33, 36
    PT->>I: see all estimates and who gave them
    %% covers 10, 11, 12
    M->>R: accept the average or the agreed estimate
    R->>I: accepted estimate
